- REDIRECT: it changes to a different destination.

Report the mechanical outcome that actually occurs in the second draft, not merely what the player requested or an NPC discussed.
Use STOP only when the second draft actually halts the vehicle. A brief hold, delay, objection, or unresolved discussion is not a stop.
Use REDIRECT only when the second draft actually commits the vehicle to a different destination. A conditional offer or request still awaiting approval is UNCHANGED.
